# TIM certificate-chain vectors for D1 (AEF 023 §4.3.1, Annex F.2.1).
#
# Generated once with openssl, RSASSA-PSS / SHA-256 / 2048-bit, and
# committed as fixed vectors: they are inputs to the verifier under test,
# never produced by it (G1).
#
#   root      a self-signed root, the trust anchor
#   device    signed by root -- the chain that must verify
#   evil_root a DIFFERENT key with the SAME subject DN as root
#   evil_device signed by evil_root -- links up by DN, verifies against nothing
#   root_spki root's SubjectPublicKeyInfo, DER: what an integrator provisions
#   x25519_device  a device certificate signed by root whose SPKI carries the
#                  Curve25519 key AEF Annex F.2.2 mandates, plus that raw key



evil_
evil_
root_
x25519_
